<title>ISRAEL: Mofet fund Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Mofet fund Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mofet Israel Technology Fund Ltd.</p>
<p>		   (in thousands of shekels except per share data)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96     Q4 95    12-MTH 96    12-MTH 95</p>
